 "verdict": "M_n is exact, not a lower bound, for every triangular n up to T_12, and where it overlaps the published table the heuristic search had in fact found the maximum.  The exact maximiser is a unit perturbation of the staircase \u2014 every gap in {1,2,3}, the 3s strictly above the 1s \u2014 so the deviation is a two-sided boundary layer on an otherwise unchanged all-2 bulk.  That is why e_k converges: the two layers are bounded and, as k grows, independent."
